{#
  Renders the "Test generator" section — a randomized-test builder bound to bank-data/{track}.json
  (genTest/tgReveal/tgPrint, existing engine.js JS, unmodified) plus a "Full official exam paper"
  generator (genFullExam(examTitle, trackId, sections[], minutes)). Matches the site's real markup
  exactly. This section's boilerplate copy has no Arabic in the live site (same finding as
  downloads-block.njk) — hardcoded English, not invented.

  Expects: trackId, sectionId (the section's real id, e.g. 'qud-testgen' — NOT derived from
  trackId, see rail.njk), testGenerator (courseMeta.testGenerator: { examTitle, sections[], minutes })
#}
<section class="chapter testgen" id="{{ sectionId }}">
  <div class="chead"><span class="cn">✎</span><h2>Test generator</h2></div>
  <p>Build a randomised test from this subject's question bank. Pick the number of questions and a difficulty, generate, then reveal the worked answers when you're ready — or print a clean copy to hand out.</p>
  <div class="tg-controls">
    <div class="tg-field"><label>Questions</label><select class="tg-count"><option>5</option><option selected>10</option><option>15</option><option>20</option></select></div>
    <div class="tg-field"><label>Difficulty</label><select class="tg-level"><option value="all" selected>All levels</option><option value="Basic">Basic</option><option value="Intermediate">Intermediate</option><option value="Advanced">Advanced</option></select></div>
    <button class="btn primary tg-go" onclick="genTest(this)">Generate test ↻</button>
    <button class="btn tg-ans" onclick="tgReveal(this)">Show all answers</button>
    <button class="btn tg-print" onclick="tgPrint(this)">Print test ↓</button>
  </div>

  <div class="tg-divider" style="margin:18px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);"></div>
  <p style="font-weight:600;margin-bottom:10px;">Full official exam paper</p>
  <p style="font-size:.9rem;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:14px;">Based on the Saudi GAT Qudrat exam: {{ testGenerator.questionCount }} quantitative questions in {{ testGenerator.minutes }} minutes. Includes standard MCQ and Quantitative Comparison items (Arabic/English bilingual). No calculator.</p>
  <div class="tg-controls">
    <button class="btn amber" onclick="genFullExam(this,'{{ testGenerator.examTitle }}','{{ trackId }}',[{% for s in testGenerator.sections %}'{{ s }}'{% if not loop.last %},{% endif %}{% endfor %}],30)">Generate Full {{ testGenerator.examTitle }} ↻</button>
    <button class="btn tg-print" onclick="tgPrint(this)">Print paper ↓</button>
  </div>
  <div class="tg-out" aria-live="polite"></div>
</section>
